    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004090/extras/1db0b39ea0d999eb7f382602aadace45.poster.avif?t=1723826830\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004090/extras/1db0b39ea0d999eb7f382602aadace45.gif?t=1723826830\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>Unbodied, a small adventure in which you play a skeleton whose body has been stolen. Control your magic wand, solve all the puzzles and find all the spells to finish with the powerful wizard and thus, recover what is yours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles, Puzzles, Puzzles!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004090/extras/084b8991452ec729abbdf41355dc57c8.poster.avif?t=1723826830\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004090/extras/084b8991452ec729abbdf41355dc57c8.webm?t=1723826830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004090/extras/084b8991452ec729abbdf41355dc57c8.mp4?t=1723826830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strange characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004090/extras/157b4bbbab8bd77d7d20ca9c90f17c03.poster.avif?t=1723826830\" width=600 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004090/extras/157b4bbbab8bd77d7d20ca9c90f17c03.webm?t=1723826830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004090/extras/157b4bbbab8bd77d7d20ca9c90f17c03.mp4?t=1723826830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid